e room.»"},"subHold":7.533,"id":"L005"},{"actor":"khaled","start":31.199,"text":{"en":"There are three sofas in the room. Three is more than one.","ar":"There are three sofas in the room. ثلاثة أكثر من واحد."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"khaled","start":35.869,"text":{"en":"How much chairs do you have?","ar":"صحّح هذه الجملة: «How much chairs do you have?»"},"subHold":6.999,"id":"L007"},{"actor":"khaled","start":42.868,"text":{"en":"How many chairs do you have? We count chairs.","ar":"How many chairs do you have? نحن نعدّ الكراسي."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"khaled","start":47.226,"text":{"en":"There isn't some glue.","ar":"صحّح هذه الجملة: «There isn't some glue.»"},"subHold":6.358,"id":"L009"},{"actor":"khaled","start":53.584,"text":{"en":"There isn't any glue. Any goes in a minus sentence.","ar":"There isn't any glue. Any تأتي في الجملة المنفيّة."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"khaled","start":58.374,"text":{"en":"There are much foam in the box.","ar":"صحّح هذه الجملة: «There are much foam in the box.»"},"subHold":7.344,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"khaled","start":65.718,"text":{"en":"There is much foam in the box. Foam is not counted.","ar":"There is much foam in the box. الإسفنج غير معدود."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"sami","start":70.628,"text":{"en":"The mistake there was are, not much.","ar":"الخطأ هناك كان are، وليس much."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"khaled","start":73.882,"text":{"en":"We don't have many wood.","ar":"صحّح هذه الجملة: «We don't have many wood.»"},"subHold":6.548,"id":"L014"},{"actor":"khaled","start":80.43,"text":{"en":"We don't have much wood. We do not count wood.","ar":"We don't have much wood. نحن لا نعدّ الخشب."},"id":"L015"},{"actor":"sami","start":84.644,"text":{"en":"Now two questions. Which sentence is correct?","ar":"الآن سؤالان. أيّ جملة صحيحة؟"},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"sami","start":89.362,"text":{"en":"There is many chairs, there are many chairs, there are much chairs, or there is many chair?","ar":"أيّها صحيح من هذه الجمل الأربع؟"},"subHold":13.808,"id":"L017"},{"actor":"sami","start":103.17,"text":{"en":"B. There are many chairs.","ar":"ب. There are many chairs."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"sami","start":105.896,"text":{"en":"How much woods, how many wood, how much wood, or how many woods we need?","ar":"أيّ سؤال صحيح من هذه الأربعة؟"},"subHold":12.779,"id":"L019"},{"actor":"sami","start":118.675,"text":{"en":"C. How much wood do we need?","ar":"ج. How much wood do we need?"},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"sami","start":121.665,"text":{"en":"Wood has no plural here. We never say woods.","ar":"الخشب ليس له جمع هنا. لا نقول woods أبداً."},"id":"L021"},{"actor":"sami","start":126.527,"text":{"en":"Chairs do have a plural, and they take many.","ar":"الكراسي لها جمع، وتأخذ many."},"id":"L022"},{"actor":"sami","start":130.141,"text":{"en":"That is the whole rule. Keep it in your pocket.","ar":"تلك هي القاعدة كلّها. احتفظ بها في جيبك."},"id":"L023"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"textMode":"wrapShrink","lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"f3775943cc97245f","bytes":38448,"sha":"cbea253afcdf9ead","address":"lines/f3775943cc97245f.mp3"},{"key":"591d6ea6cb5c740a","bytes":42048,"sha":"975b098589d7f89a","address":"lines/591d6ea6cb5c740a.mp3"},{"key":"06d8da626a215227","bytes":28800,"sha":"0f90ad0b4f32067f","address":"lines/06d8da626a215227.mp3"},{"key":"0e47f5a1bdb4959d","bytes":21600,"sha":"23a0273edcb3579b","address":"lines/0e47f5a1bdb4959d.mp3"},{"key":"e39028556223198a","bytes":15552,"sha":"36f8ce49c530893e","address":"lines/e39028556223198a.mp3"},{"key":"184633a56fefca44","bytes":25920,"sha":"c4120fe5d3c83851","address":"lines/184633a56fefca44.mp3"},{"key":"b88af6fe6177ab7d","bytes":14112,"sha":"d61f939b95f7a8e5","address":"lines/b88af6fe6177ab7d.mp3"},{"key":"5c61e78654fbcad0","bytes":24048,"sha":"afa1b2f4b77cac76","address":"lines/5c61e78654fbcad0.mp3"},{"key":"582954fff8eac3e7","bytes":12384,"sha":"e830469334a3976f","address":"